<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11877" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūmātĭlis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cȳm-</span></b> ),
		e, adj.
		from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα</span>, with the Lat. ending
			ilis. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj., of the waves</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Neptune</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Commod. 10, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Esp., <i>sea-colored, water-colored, blue</i>: colos,
			Titin. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 548, 11</span></i> (Com. Rel.
			v. 114 Rib.).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūmātĭle</span></b> ,
			is, n., <i>a bluish
			garment</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ep. 2, 2, 49</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
